Episode 19:

46
00:03:16,290 --> 00:03:20,630
Fierce Competition!

47
00:03:16,290 --> 00:03:20,630
Meiwa and Furano

48
00:03:16,290 --> 00:03:20,630
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

49
00:03:17,630 --> 00:03:19,920
Both teams have taken their positions.

50
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:22,090
Which one will advance to the finals?

51
00:03:22,090 --> 00:03:24,190
Meiwa, led by Hyuga-kun?

52
00:03:24,190 --> 00:03:27,680
Or Furano, led by Matsuyama, who values team play?

53
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:31,890
Hyuga Kojiro. I'll make you pay for what you did at the cafeteria!

54
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:34,520
Team play, my foot!

55
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:38,520
I'll demolish that kind of football!

56
00:03:39,380 --> 00:03:43,780
The first match of the semi-finals begins with Meiwa's kick-off.

57
00:03:43,780 --> 00:03:45,280
It has started!

58
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:48,770
Despite being a 4th grader, supporting his team with great effort...

59
00:03:48,780 --> 00:03:51,670
...Sawada Takeshi-kun dribbles into the opponent's half.

60
00:03:51,670 --> 00:03:53,290
Alright! Let's get this done today too!

61
00:03:53,290 --> 00:03:55,690
Don't underestimate him just because he's a 4th grader!

62
00:03:55,690 --> 00:03:57,400
He's very talented at playing!

63
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,040
Okay!

64
00:03:59,670 --> 00:04:00,670
Hyuga-san!

65
00:04:01,550 --> 00:04:02,800
Nice pass!

66
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:06,300
Meiwa quickly delivers the ball to Hyuga Kojiro-kun.

67
00:04:06,300 --> 00:04:08,260
Good. First, the first goal!

68
00:04:08,260 --> 00:04:10,680
Hyuga-kun dribbles forward.

69
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:12,160
Leave it to me!

70
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:15,730
Furano Captain Matsuyama Hikaru-kun comes out to mark Hyuga-kun.

71
00:04:15,730 --> 00:04:18,060
I won't give you any chances today!

72
00:04:18,060 --> 00:04:20,650
I hope you've prepared yourself, Hyuga!

73
00:04:20,650 --> 00:04:22,740
Stop me if you can!

74
00:04:22,740 --> 00:04:24,690
Important moments are already happening!

75
00:04:24,690 --> 00:04:26,790
A one-on-one battle between two star players!

76
00:04:26,790 --> 00:04:28,340
That's to be expected from Matsuyama-kun.

77
00:04:28,340 --> 00:04:30,210
He's not allowing it.

78
00:04:30,210 --> 00:04:33,600
Hyuga-kun still keeps the ball wonderfully.

79
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:35,160
Neither of them is backing down.

80
00:04:36,670 --> 00:04:38,040
Damn it!

81
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:40,290
This kid is pretty good.

82
00:04:40,290 --> 00:04:43,570
We can't let him continue like this! We have to support our captain!

83
00:04:43,570 --> 00:04:44,550
Yes!

84
00:04:44,550 --> 00:04:48,660
Furano's eleven, running out of patience, comes to help!

85
00:04:48,660 --> 00:04:49,550
Captain!

86
00:04:50,460 --> 00:04:51,930
Boys!

87
00:04:51,930 --> 00:04:52,680
Takeshi!

88
00:04:53,020 --> 00:04:53,680
Okay!

89
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:56,140
Hyuga-kun passes to Sawada-kun for the first time.

90
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:59,850
What?! Matsuyama-kun intercepts the ball!

91
00:04:59,850 --> 00:05:00,560
What?!

92
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:01,440
That's it!

93
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:02,190
Damn it!

94
00:05:02,190 --> 00:05:03,440
Kaneda!

95
00:05:03,940 --> 00:05:05,900
Furano is counter-attacking!

96
00:05:05,900 --> 00:05:07,420
Don't take me lightly...

97
00:05:07,420 --> 00:05:09,740
I'm not going to swallow this!

98
00:05:11,970 --> 00:05:13,240
Watch out, Kaneda!

99
00:05:14,540 --> 00:05:17,330
Hyuga-kun's special sliding tackle!

100
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:20,630
Keep it up!

101
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,290
Hyuga!

102
00:05:22,290 --> 00:05:23,990
That's to be expected from Hyuga-kun!

103
00:05:23,990 --> 00:05:25,790
He has incredible determination!

104
00:05:25,790 --> 00:05:29,500
He won the ball back with a sliding tackle in the blink of an eye...

105
00:05:29,510 --> 00:05:31,800
...and is now advancing towards the Furano goal!

106
00:05:33,430 --> 00:05:35,180
Everyone fall back! Fall back!

107
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:40,190
Right now, there's nothing in my head except becoming champion.

108
00:05:40,190 --> 00:05:43,320
Hyuga-kun reaches the front of the goal instantly!

109
00:05:43,900 --> 00:05:47,360
I will win! I will win no matter what!

110
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,820
My...

111
00:05:48,820 --> 00:05:51,320
Hyuga-kun quickly prepares to shoot!

112
00:05:51,900 --> 00:05:55,580
I have no choice but to win!

113
00:05:56,730 --> 00:05:57,910
Goal!

114
00:05:57,910 --> 00:05:59,830
Meiwa opens the scoring!

115
00:05:59,830 --> 00:06:01,580
You did it, Hyuga-san!

116
00:06:01,580 --> 00:06:03,410
He's in great form again today.

117
00:06:03,410 --> 00:06:06,090
Meiwa's furious tiger, Hyuga Kojiro-kun!

118
00:06:06,090 --> 00:06:08,840
This is his 25th goal in the tournament.

119
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:13,470
He's tied with Nankatsu's Ozora Tsubasa-kun for the goal king title.

120
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:17,520
They scored right away...

121
00:06:17,520 --> 00:06:19,520
No problem, boys!

122
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:23,770
The game just started, and Meiwa is a one-man team consisting of Hyuga.

123
00:06:23,770 --> 00:06:27,400
Let's teach them that football is a team game!

124
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:28,570
Okay!

125
00:06:29,470 --> 00:06:32,160
Furano continued to fight against Meiwa, but...

126
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,410
I won't allow it!

127
00:06:34,650 --> 00:06:37,290
Hyuga-kun's sliding tackles are too strong!

128
00:06:37,290 --> 00:06:38,440
Nakagawa!

129
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:43,380
They couldn't mount an attack worth mentioning while Hyuga Kojiro was blocking their path.

130
00:06:43,380 --> 00:06:45,760
Meiwa really is better.

131
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:47,630
You can't understand it now.

132
00:06:48,380 --> 00:06:51,630
A lot of snow falls where Furano Elementary is.

133
00:06:52,900 --> 00:06:57,440
Everyone does heavy practice in that deep snow every day.

134
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:58,890
Come on, let me hear your voice!

135
00:06:58,890 --> 00:07:01,430
Don't let this much snow discourage you!

136
00:07:01,430 --> 00:07:04,110
That's why their endurance and determination are very high.

137
00:07:04,110 --> 00:07:05,190
Captain!

138
00:07:05,190 --> 00:07:07,190
Furano finds an opportunity!

139
00:07:07,190 --> 00:07:09,690
Matsuyama-kun in front of the goal got the ball!

140
00:07:09,690 --> 00:07:10,950
Wide open!

141
00:07:10,950 --> 00:07:12,500
Alright, I'll get the equalizer!

142
00:07:12,500 --> 00:07:14,070
Matsuyama-kun is going to shoot!

143
00:07:14,070 --> 00:07:15,490
I won't allow it!

144
00:07:15,490 --> 00:07:18,330
But Hyuga-kun is behind him to stop him!

145
00:07:18,330 --> 00:07:19,910
Here you come, Hyuga.

146
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:23,850
What?!

147
00:07:23,850 --> 00:07:27,420
It's very clear he hit his foot instead of the ball!

148
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,630
An obvious foul.

149
00:07:30,630 --> 00:07:32,580
Furano will take a penalty.

150
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:35,180
Hyuga.

151
00:07:36,110 --> 00:07:39,560
I beat your sliding tackle.

152
00:07:40,350 --> 00:07:42,810
Bastard... Did you put your foot there on purpose?

153
00:07:42,810 --> 00:07:44,980
Hyuga-kun receives a yellow card.

154
00:07:44,980 --> 00:07:47,060
He'll be sent off with a second yellow.

155
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:50,820
Hyuga-kun can no longer move as freely as he wants.

156
00:07:52,740 --> 00:07:58,710
Even though Furano won a penalty, is Matsuyama-kun's leg okay?

157
00:07:58,710 --> 00:08:01,160
I'm not going to be discouraged by a tackle like that.

158
00:08:01,570 --> 00:08:02,900
I'll teach you, Hyuga.

159
00:08:02,900 --> 00:08:04,900
Football isn't played alone.

160
00:08:04,900 --> 00:08:09,920
We, Furano, will beat the one-man Meiwa team!

161
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:19,140
Furano got a chance to equalize.

162
00:08:19,140 --> 00:08:22,220
Matsuyama-kun, slowly placing the ball, adjusts the distance.

163
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:26,190
Alright.

164
00:08:34,940 --> 00:08:36,340
Goal!

165
00:08:36,340 --> 00:08:37,740
The goalkeeper couldn't even move.

166
00:08:37,740 --> 00:08:40,240
Furano equalizes!

167
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,990
- You did it!
- That's it!

168
00:08:42,860 --> 00:08:44,070
So you let it in?

169
00:08:49,300 --> 00:08:51,840
We'll take the lead back immediately.

170
00:08:52,570 --> 00:08:58,010
However, from this moment on, Kojiro was completely outmatched by Furano's passing.

171
00:08:59,390 --> 00:09:01,430
The first half ends!

172
00:09:01,430 --> 00:09:04,100
At the end of the first half, the score is 1-1.

173
00:09:04,100 --> 00:09:06,440
Furano is fighting with everything they have.

174
00:09:06,830 --> 00:09:10,440
They are not inferior at all to Meiwa, who are ambitious for the championship.

175
00:09:10,830 --> 00:09:14,440
Captain Matsuyama-kun's efforts cannot be overlooked in this.

176
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:19,410
After Meiwa's goal star Hyuga-kun scored at the beginning of the match...

177
00:09:19,410 --> 00:09:21,580
...they completely cornered him.

178
00:09:22,220 --> 00:09:23,790
Is your leg okay?

179
00:09:23,790 --> 00:09:25,620
Nothing to worry about.

180
00:09:25,620 --> 00:09:28,210
More importantly, let's continue like this in the second half.

181
00:09:28,210 --> 00:09:29,780
We can win, kids!

182
00:09:29,780 --> 00:09:30,880
Yes!

183
00:09:34,460 --> 00:09:38,220
Hyuga-kun looks a bit strange today.

184
00:09:40,220 --> 00:09:42,050
Damn it!

185
00:09:44,990 --> 00:09:46,850
Hyuga-san...

186
00:09:47,650 --> 00:09:50,860
Kojiro, you're pushing the impossible.

187
00:09:50,860 --> 00:09:57,820
While working part-time to help your family, you single-handedly brought Meiwa this far.

188
00:09:58,340 --> 00:10:03,830
A normal elementary school student would have lost his mind by now.

189
00:10:05,210 --> 00:10:06,360
Takeshi.

190
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,370
Yes?

191
00:10:08,060 --> 00:10:10,480
Listen. Just like in the Nankatsu match...

192
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:13,300
...you'll be the key in this match too.

193
00:10:13,300 --> 00:10:16,520
No one but you can help Hyuga right now.

194
00:10:16,520 --> 00:10:17,920
Y-Yes.

195
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,290
Hyuga-san...

196
00:10:23,820 --> 00:10:26,920
I first met Hyuga-san last spring.

197
00:10:27,870 --> 00:10:30,640
I was still in 3rd grade back then.

198
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:32,400
One, two...

199
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:35,900
Finally, tomorrow is the Meiwa FC tryouts.

200
00:10:35,900 --> 00:10:38,280
I'll definitely pass!

201
00:10:39,790 --> 00:10:40,570
My ball...

202
00:10:41,530 --> 00:10:45,620
Look here, you. If you're not going to play football from the heart, quit.

203
00:10:45,620 --> 00:10:46,620
What?

204
00:10:46,620 --> 00:10:49,760
When you're standing on the field, everyone around you is an opponent.

205
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:52,880
And these opponents can come from all sides.

206
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:58,010
If you want to join Meiwa FC, prepare yourself for that.

207
00:10:59,290 --> 00:11:02,260
I didn't know who he was back then.

208
00:11:03,540 --> 00:11:06,690
Please! Let me participate in the entrance exam!

209
00:11:06,690 --> 00:11:10,810
I'm telling you, the rules say only those older than 4th grade can enter.

210
00:11:10,810 --> 00:11:12,030
I'm begging you!

211
00:11:12,030 --> 00:11:13,190
At least let me try!

212
00:11:13,190 --> 00:11:14,920
Don't block the shop entrance!

213
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:17,190
Let him try.

214
00:11:17,890 --> 00:11:18,780
Hyuga!

215
00:11:18,780 --> 00:11:20,650
You're the person from before!

216
00:11:21,070 --> 00:11:23,580
Age is irrelevant in football.

217
00:11:23,580 --> 00:11:25,620
Football is a battle of talent.

218
00:11:25,620 --> 00:11:26,620
What did you say?!

219
00:11:26,620 --> 00:11:30,930
After all, even though I'm 5th grade, no 6th grader can stand against me, right?!

220
00:11:31,460 --> 00:11:31,880
What?!

221
00:11:31,880 --> 00:11:32,900
Here!

222
00:11:32,900 --> 00:11:36,340
Thanks to Hyuga-san, I was able to take the entrance exam.

223
00:11:36,340 --> 00:11:39,890
That short one is really good, isn't he?

224
00:11:39,890 --> 00:11:42,100
And he's only 3rd grade.

225
00:11:42,100 --> 00:11:43,880
Is that so?

226
00:11:43,880 --> 00:11:47,040
After that, Coach Kira's special training began.

227
00:11:47,040 --> 00:11:48,500
Not yet, Takeshi!

228
00:11:48,500 --> 00:11:49,270
Okay!

229
00:11:49,270 --> 00:11:54,520
When I learned that Hyuga-san works while playing football to help his family...

230
00:11:54,520 --> 00:11:59,280
...my respect for Hyuga-san grew even more.

231
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:01,460
And I made a vow.

232
00:12:01,460 --> 00:12:06,450
I will wave the championship flag together with Hyuga-san.

233
00:12:07,790 --> 00:12:09,660
The second half begins!

234
00:12:09,660 --> 00:12:11,910
You haven't seen my true power yet!

235
00:12:11,910 --> 00:12:14,170
I'll show you so much you won't be able to handle it!

236
00:12:14,170 --> 00:12:14,920
Take this!

237
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:17,580
Hyuga-kun steals the ball!

238
00:12:17,580 --> 00:12:19,750
He dribbles in the opponent's half.

239
00:12:19,750 --> 00:12:21,050
I'll mark him!

240
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:23,670
Matsuyama-kun comes again to keep Hyuga-kun in check!

241
00:12:23,670 --> 00:12:26,470
Another clash between the two star players!

242
00:12:26,470 --> 00:12:29,280
Matsuyama-kun gets the ball.

243
00:12:29,280 --> 00:12:29,970
Damn it!

244
00:12:29,970 --> 00:12:30,930
What?!

245
00:12:30,930 --> 00:12:34,810
Sawada-kun from Meiwa gets the ball!

246
00:12:34,810 --> 00:12:35,730
Takeshi!

247
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:37,810
Hyuga-san!

248
00:12:38,780 --> 00:12:39,810
I won't allow it!

249
00:12:39,810 --> 00:12:41,810
Furano's defense is unprepared!

250
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:44,080
Sawada-kun sends a cross!

251
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:45,400
A high ball!

252
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:47,200
Can Matsuyama-kun intercept it?

253
00:12:48,950 --> 00:12:52,120
Not working! The ball goes over him!

254
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:54,340
Nice pass, Takeshi!

255
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:58,420
Goal!

256
00:12:58,420 --> 00:13:00,630
Hyuga-kun scores his second goal today!

257
00:13:01,080 --> 00:13:05,380
With this goal, Hyuga-kun becomes the tournament's goal king!

258
00:13:05,380 --> 00:13:10,890
Although the duo play of Nankatsu's Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun is much talked about in this tournament...

259
00:13:10,890 --> 00:13:14,520
...the duo play of Meiwa's Hyuga-kun and Sawada-kun is also making a name for itself.

260
00:13:14,520 --> 00:13:18,980
When these two are together, Meiwa FC is truly very strong!

261
00:13:19,850 --> 00:13:26,480
Exactly. I will support Hyuga-san until the end of the tournament, and we will definitely become champions!

262
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:33,960
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

263
00:13:34,520 --> 00:13:38,230
The first semi-final match of the National Youth Football Tournament...

264
00:13:38,230 --> 00:13:41,000
...the match between Meiwa and Furano is nearing its end.

265
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:45,130
5 minutes to the final whistle, and Meiwa leads 2-1.

266
00:13:45,130 --> 00:13:47,620
Even though Furano constantly threatens the goal...

267
00:13:47,620 --> 00:13:49,640
...Meiwa is holding on very well.

268
00:13:50,160 --> 00:13:54,640
A lot of struggle has taken place between Meiwa and Furano.

269
00:13:54,640 --> 00:13:57,140
Fatigue should have set in by now.

270
00:13:57,140 --> 00:13:58,630
But they are doing their best!

271
00:13:58,630 --> 00:14:01,150
Both sides are fighting until the very end!

272
00:14:01,150 --> 00:14:02,670
Do your best, Furano!

273
00:14:02,670 --> 00:14:03,900
Push a little more!

274
00:14:03,900 --> 00:14:07,150
I will never lose to the likes of you!

275
00:14:07,150 --> 00:14:11,510
There's definitely something unusual in Hyuga-kun's body in today's match.

276
00:14:11,510 --> 00:14:14,660
Matsuyama also injured his leg because of Hyuga's tackle.

277
00:14:14,660 --> 00:14:17,910
We still can't predict who will emerge victorious from this match.

278
00:14:19,480 --> 00:14:21,920
There's no way an injury like this can stop me!

279
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:23,170
Captain!

280
00:14:23,170 --> 00:14:25,920
A pass comes to Matsuyama-kun!

281
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:28,800
Crush him! Don't let him pass!

282
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:31,430
A wall pass is coming!

283
00:14:31,430 --> 00:14:33,300
Can Furano continue the attack?

284
00:14:33,300 --> 00:14:34,810
I won't allow it!

285
00:14:35,410 --> 00:14:38,480
Matsuyama-kun's foot gets caught!

286
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,230
Oh no!

287
00:14:41,660 --> 00:14:43,520
Meiwa commits a foul.

288
00:14:43,520 --> 00:14:45,490
Ishii-kun receives a yellow card.

289
00:14:45,490 --> 00:14:47,150
Furano will take a free kick.

290
00:14:47,150 --> 00:14:48,150
Captain!

291
00:14:49,790 --> 00:14:51,240
Damn it!

292
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:53,870
Something like this can't discourage me!

293
00:14:54,260 --> 00:14:55,410
Captain...

294
00:14:55,410 --> 00:14:59,160
When it comes to training, we don't lose to anyone!

295
00:14:59,810 --> 00:15:04,620
Compared to the times we trained in that cold snow...

296
00:15:04,620 --> 00:15:07,170
...this can't even be called a difficulty!

297
00:15:08,010 --> 00:15:10,370
Boys, I know it's hard.

298
00:15:10,370 --> 00:15:11,920
But we have to try a little more!

299
00:15:11,920 --> 00:15:14,640
Let's show them the results of our training so far!

300
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:15,850
Yes!

301
00:15:17,020 --> 00:15:19,500
They'll take a free kick from this spot.

302
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:21,850
Furano has a chance to equalize.

303
00:15:21,850 --> 00:15:23,060
Damn it!

304
00:15:23,060 --> 00:15:24,940
A dangerous position.

305
00:15:26,460 --> 00:15:27,610
Hyuga-san!

306
00:15:28,790 --> 00:15:30,530
You have a fever!

307
00:15:30,530 --> 00:15:32,490
No problem, Takeshi.

308
00:15:32,490 --> 00:15:34,280
There are three forwards.

309
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:37,160
Where will Furano's Matsuyama-kun send it?

310
00:15:37,990 --> 00:15:39,080
I'm counting on you!

311
00:15:40,870 --> 00:15:42,120
To the far post!

312
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:43,580
An aerial ball battle!

313
00:15:43,580 --> 00:15:46,920
Compared to our jumps in the snow...

314
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:47,760
Take this!

315
00:15:47,760 --> 00:15:48,420
What?!

316
00:15:48,420 --> 00:15:50,280
The ball goes to the right!

317
00:15:50,280 --> 00:15:51,630
Damn it! I have to close it down!

318
00:15:52,250 --> 00:15:54,640
It's going to the right again!

319
00:15:54,640 --> 00:15:56,720
And Oda-kun shoots!

320
00:15:57,540 --> 00:15:59,100
Will Furano equalize?!

321
00:15:59,100 --> 00:16:01,220
No, they can't!

322
00:16:02,100 --> 00:16:04,060
Hyuga-kun blocks it by a hair's breadth!

323
00:16:04,060 --> 00:16:07,270
But the ball comes to Matsuyama-kun!

324
00:16:07,980 --> 00:16:08,860
Damn it!

325
00:16:08,860 --> 00:16:10,360
I won't let you shoot!

326
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:12,860
Sawada-kun tries to stop it with a slide!

327
00:16:12,860 --> 00:16:15,820
Who is faster, Matsuyama-kun or Sawada-kun?

328
00:16:18,010 --> 00:16:19,840
Matsuyama-kun succeeds!

329
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:21,330
Furano equalizes!

330
00:16:21,330 --> 00:16:23,740
You did it, Captain! Nice shot!

331
00:16:23,740 --> 00:16:26,830
Furano ties the score with team play!

332
00:16:26,830 --> 00:16:28,750
Perfect.

333
00:16:26,830 --> 00:16:28,750
- Amazing.
- Perfect.

334
00:16:33,510 --> 00:16:34,670
Let's go.

335
00:16:34,670 --> 00:16:37,390
Furano applies pressure with combined strength.

336
00:16:38,420 --> 00:16:39,930
Damn it...

337
00:16:39,930 --> 00:16:42,930
Who the hell are you guys?!

338
00:16:42,930 --> 00:16:45,600
Hyuga-kun is going to make a sliding tackle!

339
00:16:46,160 --> 00:16:47,540
He dodged it!

340
00:16:47,540 --> 00:16:48,110
What?!

341
00:16:49,240 --> 00:16:50,780
The ball goes in front of the goal!

342
00:16:50,780 --> 00:16:51,980
How?!

343
00:16:51,980 --> 00:16:54,490
Oda-kun runs towards the ball.

344
00:16:54,490 --> 00:16:56,740
Stop him! Don't let him shoot!

345
00:16:59,920 --> 00:17:01,580
H-Handball!

346
00:17:01,580 --> 00:17:04,540
Meiwa commits a foul inside the penalty area!

347
00:17:05,850 --> 00:17:07,790
Furano will take a penalty!

348
00:17:09,740 --> 00:17:11,680
A-A penalty...

349
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:13,550
What kind of thing is this?!

350
00:17:13,550 --> 00:17:17,050
Less than one minute remains until the match ends.

351
00:17:17,540 --> 00:17:21,310
Furano got a chance to earn a ticket to the finals.

352
00:17:21,820 --> 00:17:24,770
A-Am I... Am I going to lose in a place like this?

353
00:17:24,780 --> 00:17:27,100
A-Am I... Am I going to lose in a place like this?

354
00:17:28,570 --> 00:17:30,190
Hyuga-kun...

355
00:17:30,650 --> 00:17:34,080
The person taking the penalty is the one who also took the penalty in the first half...

356
00:17:34,080 --> 00:17:36,450
...Furano Captain Matsuyama Hikaru-kun.

357
00:17:36,450 --> 00:17:38,450
Captain, we're counting on you!

358
00:17:38,450 --> 00:17:39,200
Okay!

359
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:43,310
But this penalty is all of ours!

360
00:17:43,310 --> 00:17:47,230
So I'll take it while putting all of our feelings into it!

361
00:17:47,230 --> 00:17:48,210
Yes!

362
00:17:50,870 --> 00:17:52,000
Alright.

363
00:18:05,560 --> 00:18:06,310
Stop!

364
00:18:08,330 --> 00:18:10,440
Goalkeeper change!

365
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:12,730
W-Wakashimazu?!

366
00:18:12,730 --> 00:18:13,820
You've come!

367
00:18:13,820 --> 00:18:14,980
Wakashimazu-san!

368
00:18:14,980 --> 00:18:17,190
A goalkeeper change?

369
00:18:17,740 --> 00:18:21,670
I've brought the unbeatable goalkeeper Wakashimazu Ken.

370
00:18:21,670 --> 00:18:26,480
He had a traffic accident a few months ago, but he returned like a phoenix!

371
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:27,320
- We're counting on you.
- I'm leaving it to you, Wakashimazu.

372
00:18:34,300 --> 00:18:36,090
Wakashimazu.

373
00:18:36,090 --> 00:18:39,510
Captain, when I catch it, I'll pass to you.

374
00:18:46,170 --> 00:18:49,060
Wakashimazu-kun has taken his position.

375
00:18:50,560 --> 00:18:54,320
Whoever the goalkeeper is, I will definitely convert this into a goal!

376
00:18:59,650 --> 00:19:02,410
The penalty obtained by putting everyone's strength together!

377
00:19:02,410 --> 00:19:06,040
Even if my leg breaks, I will score this!

378
00:19:07,060 --> 00:19:10,040
Matsuyama-kun sends a bullet-like ball without hesitation!

379
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:15,530
H-He caught it!

380
00:19:15,530 --> 00:19:18,010
Wakashimazu-kun catches the ball!

381
00:19:18,390 --> 00:19:19,880
Let's go, Captain!

382
00:19:22,240 --> 00:19:25,050
Wakashimazu-kun passes to Hyuga-kun without delay!

383
00:19:25,050 --> 00:19:27,060
Oh no! Go after Hyuga!

384
00:19:27,060 --> 00:19:30,810
Hyuga-kun runs towards the Furano goal with his last strength!

385
00:19:30,810 --> 00:19:35,140
And Furano chases after him with all their might in the final seconds!

386
00:19:35,140 --> 00:19:37,570
The final battle between Meiwa and Furano!

387
00:19:37,570 --> 00:19:42,240
The running Hyuga-kun passes midfield and continues running in Furano's half!

388
00:19:43,770 --> 00:19:44,740
My leg...

389
00:19:45,160 --> 00:19:47,160
I'm counting on you, everyone...

390
00:19:50,340 --> 00:19:53,460
I have to... I have to shoot at the goal.

391
00:19:53,460 --> 00:19:55,920
Damn it. We'll definitely catch you.

392
00:19:58,860 --> 00:20:01,300
At the goal... I have to shoot.

393
00:20:03,710 --> 00:20:07,970
The ball is caught between Furano's tackle and Hyuga-kun's shot!

394
00:20:09,940 --> 00:20:10,470
What?!

395
00:20:15,950 --> 00:20:17,400
G-Goal!

396
00:20:18,920 --> 00:20:21,740
The final whistle blows!

397
00:20:22,740 --> 00:20:25,990
A very... very dramatic result!

398
00:20:25,990 --> 00:20:27,650
3-2!

399
00:20:27,650 --> 00:20:31,130
The fierce cat-and-mouse game has come to an end.

400
00:20:31,130 --> 00:20:34,000
Meiwa FC defeats Furano despite the difficulty.

401
00:20:34,730 --> 00:20:36,500
That's to be expected from the Captain.

